## FAN-STORY & DUBBING POLICY:
The characters and species in this book (The
VONS) are the original Intellectual Property
of Avyaan Mishra
## Custom Stories:
 I am permitting People to create
and share original “Fan-Stories” or “Dubs” using
these characters, provided they are based strictly on
the VONS universe. I permit no external character
in custom stories on these Characters.
## Credit & Copyright:
 Any such
creation must include a clear credit
line: “Characters and Original Universe created by
Avyaan Mishra.”
## Physical Restriction: 
This permission is for
digital/fan use only. No one may print or sell
physical copies of stories using these characters
without the author's permission.
## Integrity: 
All fan-made content must respect the
established "Sibling Bonds" and biology of the
species. I am not permitting inappropriate contents
on these Characters.